  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Salty Clouds creates effortless, everyday jewellery designed to be worn on repeat. Our pieces are waterproof, tarnish-free, and made to keep up with real life, from pilates to dinner. Inspired by a modern capsule wardrobe, each piece is designed to make you feel more put together, every day.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">As an affiliate, you’ll receive a personalised 15% discount code to share with your audience, and you’ll earn $10 AUD for every new customer who shops using your code.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">You’re welcome to promote Salty Clouds in any way that feels natural to you, whether that’s through social media, content creation, or simply sharing with friends and family.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">There are no ongoing obligations, just a simple referral program designed to reward you for sharing pieces you genuinely love 🤎</p></div></div>",
